# src/packages/lumicore/src/routing

## Purpose
Native routing primitives.

## Contents
- Direct files (33): `adaptive_outbound_coordinator.rs`, `async_rule_evaluator.rs`, `autonomous_routing_coordinator.rs`, `autoproxy_ruleset_matcher.rs`, `canonical_blacklist_engine.rs`, `composite_rule_compiler.rs`, `core_context_builder.rs`, `dynamic_gateway_updater.rs`, `enhanced_geoip_lookup.rs`, `geospatial_polygon_router.rs`, `intelligent_traffic_filter.rs`, `mesh_wireguard_coordinator.rs` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Rust module membership is controlled by `mod.rs`/`lib.rs`; Cargo is compile authority.
- Host-facing changes must preserve the versioned FFI envelope and private Go ABI declaration checks.

## Invariants
- Do not advertise or promote dormant native surfaces without the Cargo/ABI/CGO verification gate.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
